## Schema & naming

- Follow naming rules in `[naming-conventions.md](mdc:docs/database/rules/naming-conventions.md)`.
- Use data types defined in `[data-types-standards.md](mdc:docs/database/rules/data-types-standards.md)`.
- Keep the overall schema in sync with `[current-schema.md](mdc:docs/database/schema/current-schema.md)`.

## Migrations

- Follow `[migration-policy.md](mdc:docs/database/migrations/migration-policy.md)` when adding or changing tables.
- Record each migration in `[migration-history.md](mdc:docs/database/migrations/migration-history.md)`.

## Indexes & constraints

- Design indexes according to `[indexing-strategy.md](mdc:docs/database/rules/indexing-strategy.md)`.
- Apply foreign keys and constraints per `[constraints-policy.md](mdc:docs/database/rules/constraints-policy.md)`.

